msgid "Put it on a page"
msgstr "Coloque em uma página"

#: src/Admin/WelcomeScreen.php:185
msgid "Every audiobook has its own page, player included. To place one anywhere else, use the Audiobook, Chapter list and Continue listening blocks in the editor."
